msgid "---"
msgstr ""
"## v1.1.0\n"
"\n"
"### 新增功能\n"
"\n"
"- 支持在 `config.json` 中配置 `max_tokens` 参数，以控制生成文本的长度上限。\n"
"- 新增 `--version` 命令行选项，用于显示当前版本信息。\n"
"- 增加对 `gpt-4o` 模型的支持，并优化了模型选择逻辑。\n"
"\n"
"### 修复\n"
"\n"
"- 修复了在某些情况下，API 请求超时导致程序崩溃的问题。\n"
"- 修复了 `--output` 参数在指定目录不存在时无法自动创建的问题。\n"
"- 修复了在 Windows 系统下，路径包含中文时无法正确读取文件的问题。\n"
"\n"
"### 优化\n"
"\n"
"- 优化了日志输出格式，使其更易于阅读和排查问题。\n"
"- 提升了 API 调用的并发性能，减少了等待时间。\n"
"- 更新了依赖库至最新稳定版本。\n"
"\n"
"### 文档\n"
"\n"
"- 更新了 README.md，补充了 `max_tokens` 参数的说明。\n"
"- 添加了常见问题（FAQ）文档，解答了用户经常遇到的问题。\n"

msgid "版本亮点"
msgstr "Version Highlights"

msgid "Triton-Ascend 3.2.0"
msgstr "Triton-Ascend 3.2.0"

msgid "**首次发布：Ascend NPU 支持**"
msgstr "**First Release: Ascend NPU Support**"

msgid "Triton-Ascend 3.2.0 是第一个正式支持华为 Ascend NPU 的 Triton 版本。此版本基于 Triton 3.2.0 社区版本，专门适配 Ascend NPU 硬件架构。"
msgstr "Triton-Ascend 3.2.0 is the first Triton release to officially support Huawei Ascend NPU. This version is based on the Triton 3.2.0 community release and is specifically adapted to the Ascend NPU hardware architecture."

msgid "主要特性"
msgstr "Key Features"

msgid "**Ascend NPU 全栈支持**"
msgstr "**Ascend NPU Full-Stack Support**"

msgid "完整的 Triton IR 到 NPU 指令集编译流水线"
msgstr "Complete Triton IR to NPU instruction set compilation pipeline."

msgid "支持全部 Triton Ops"
msgstr "Supports all Triton Ops."

msgid "**性能优化**"
msgstr "**Performance Optimization**"

msgid "NPU 特定内核优化"
msgstr "NPU-specific kernel optimizations"

msgid "CV 计算优化"
msgstr "CV computation optimization"

msgid "**开发者工具**"
msgstr "**Developer Tools**"

msgid "支持全面的调试输出"
msgstr "Supports comprehensive debug output."

msgid "编译中间产物转储"
msgstr "Compilation intermediate artifact dump"

msgid "已知限制"
msgstr "Known Limitations"

msgid "**数据类型**: 部分数据类型支持仍在完善中"
msgstr "**Data Types**: Support for some data types is still being refined."

msgid "**算子覆盖**: 正在持续扩展支持的算子集合"
msgstr "**Operator Coverage**: The set of supported operators is continuously expanding."

msgid "迁移指南"
msgstr "Migration Guide"

msgid "对于现有 Triton GPU 用户迁移到 Ascend NPU，详见 [GPU Triton算子迁移](./migration_guide/migrate_from_gpu.md)"
msgstr "For existing Triton GPU users migrating to Ascend NPU, see [GPU Triton Operator Migration](./migration_guide/migrate_from_gpu.md)."
